  "content": "\n\n<h1>导航器</h1>\n<p>Navigator 是一款 API 模组，允许其他模组添加对以下地图模组的集成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaeros World</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minimap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voxelmap\" rel=\"nofollow\">VoxelMap</a>（有限支持）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gtnhlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GTNHLib</a></li>\n</ul>",
